Safe behavior after this tweak:

1. Each QCFG query is accepted only when its exact named +QCFG response exists.
2. Only a validated mismatch can schedule the one required AT+CFUN=1,1 restart.
3. A failed ping sample is ignored while the cellular interface still has an IP.
4. Missing IP requests only cellular DHCP recovery; it does not reset the modem.
5. QNETDEVCTL is acted on only for exact 1,3,0 or 1,3,1 responses.
6. Crossed or malformed modem replies are logged and ignored.

The full deployed worker is archived at:
tweaks/sim_switch_network_isolation_fix/changed/usr/sbin/cellular/quectel_rm500u
